---
// Course curriculum (variant: accordion, first open, numbers + lengths) — Kestrel Academy, Brand identity systems.
---

<section id="course-curriculum" class="section course-curriculum" data-variant="accordion">
  <!-- kit: course-curriculum -->
  <div class="container narrow">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2>What you'll learn</h2>
      <p class="summary-line">2 modules · 6 lessons · 3 h 36 min</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="modules">
      <li>
        <details class="module" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="m-num">01</span>
            <span class="m-text">
              <span class="m-title">Foundations of identity</span>
              <span class="m-meta">3 lessons · 40 min</span>
            </span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="module-body">
            <p class="m-summary">Read a brief, audit an existing identity and write a positioning line the system can grow from.</p>
            <ol class="lessons">
              <li class="lesson">
                <span class="type type--video" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
                <div class="l-main">
                  <p class="l-title">1.1 What an identity system actually is <span class="badge">Free preview</span></p>
                  <p class="l-meta"><span class="visually-hidden">Type: </span>Video · 12 min · Captions</p>
                  <ul class="resources">
                    <li><a href="https://kestrel.academy/media/bis-1-1-slides.pdf" download>Slides (PDF) <span class="size">4 MB</span></a></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <a class="preview" href="https://vimeo.com/912345678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch preview</a>
              </li>
              <li class="lesson">
                <span class="type type--reading" aria-hidden="true">≡</span>
                <div class="l-main">
                  <p class="l-title">1.2 Auditing an existing brand</p>
                  <p class="l-meta"><span class="visually-hidden">Type: </span>Reading · 20 min</p>
                  <p class="l-excerpt">Before you design anything, inventory what's already out there: every logo lock-up, colour, typeface and template in use.</p>
                  <ul class="resources">
                    <li><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1kestrel-audit-template/copy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Audit spreadsheet ↗</a></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <span class="lock" aria-label="Enrolled students only">🔒</span>
              </li>
              <li class="lesson">
                <span class="type type--quiz" aria-hidden="true">?</span>
                <div class="l-main">
                  <p class="l-title">1.3 Check your understanding</p>
                  <p class="l-meta"><span class="visually-hidden">Type: </span>Quiz · 8 min</p>
                </div>
                <span class="lock" aria-label="Enrolled students only">🔒</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
      <li>
        <details class="module">
          <summary>
            <span class="m-num">02</span>
            <span class="m-text">
              <span class="m-title">Marks, type and colour</span>
              <span class="m-meta">3 lessons · 2 h 56 min · Unlocks after module 1</span>
            </span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="module-body">
            <p class="m-summary">Build a logo suite, pair typefaces with a reason, and make a colour system that passes contrast.</p>
            <ol class="lessons">
              <li class="lesson">
                <span class="type type--video" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
                <div class="l-main">
                  <p class="l-title">2.1 Designing a flexible logo suite</p>
                  <p class="l-meta"><span class="visually-hidden">Type: </span>Video · 26 min</p>
                </div>
                <span class="lock" aria-label="Enrolled students only">🔒</span>
              </li>
              <li class="lesson">
                <span class="type type--live" aria-hidden="true">●</span>
                <div class="l-main">
                  <p class="l-title">2.2 Critique with Ana Kovač</p>
                  <p class="l-meta"><span class="visually-hidden">Type: </span>Live session · 60 min · <time datetime="2026-11-12T17:00:00+00:00">12 Nov 2026, 17:00 London</time></p>
                </div>
                <span class="lock" aria-label="Enrolled students only">🔒</span>
              </li>
              <li class="lesson">
                <span class="type type--assignment" aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
                <div class="l-main">
                  <p class="l-title">2.3 Assignment: a three-colour system</p>
                  <p class="l-meta"><span class="visually-hidden">Type: </span>Assignment · 90 min</p>
                  <p class="l-excerpt">Build primary, secondary and neutral ramps. Every text pairing must reach 4.5:1.</p>
                  <ul class="resources">
                    <li><a href="https://www.figma.com/community/file/1300000000000000001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Figma starter file ↗</a></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <span class="lock" aria-label="Enrolled students only">🔒</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  .summary-line {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .modules {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .module {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .module[open] {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .m-num {
    flex: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .m-text {
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .m-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .m-meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .chev {
    flex: none;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--ink-2);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink-2);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    transition: transform 200ms ease;
  }
  .module[open] .chev {
    transform: rotate(-135deg);
  }
  .module-body {
    padding: 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .m-summary {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .lessons {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lesson {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.875rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lesson:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .type {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .type--video { color: var(--brand); background: var(--brand-soft); }
  .type--live { color: var(--success); }
  .type--quiz { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .l-main {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .l-main p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .l-title {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .l-title .badge {
    margin-left: 0.375rem;
    vertical-align: 2px;
  }
  .l-meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .l-excerpt {
    margin-top: 0.375rem !important;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .resources {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .resources a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .size {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .preview {
    flex: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .lock {
    flex: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .lesson {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .preview {
      margin-left: calc(32px + 0.875rem);
    }
  }
</style>
